<title>UK: Bank of Western Australia sets $250 mln 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank of Western Australia sets $250 mln 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK OF WESTERN AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.923    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.923</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.115     SELL CONC  0.085     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
